#: src/menus/file/print.xml:13(title)
msgid "Print"
msgstr "Skriv ut"

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:16(primary)
msgid "Printing"
msgstr "Utskrifter"

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:17(secondary)
msgid "Print command"
msgstr "Kommandot Skriv ut"

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:19(para)
msgid ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> has its own printing module. You can set page and "
"image up. A preview button allows you to verify the result before printing."
msgstr ""
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym> har en egen utskriftsmodul. Du kan ställa in sidan "
"och bilden. En förhandsvisningsknapp låter dig kontrollera resultatet före "
"utskrift."

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:25(title)
msgid "The <quote>Print</quote> dialog"
msgstr "Dialogrutan <quote>Skriv ut</quote>"

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:33(para)
msgid ""
"See <link linkend=\"gimp-using-photography-printing\">Printing your "
"photos</link>."
msgstr ""
"Se <link linkend=\"gimp-using-photography-printing\">Skriva ut dina "
"foton</link>."

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:43(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem></menuchoice>,"
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Print</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Skriv "
"ut</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/file/print.xml:52(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "or by using the keyboard shortcut "
#| "<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>."
msgid ""
"You can also use the keyboard shortcut "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också använda tangentbordsgenvägen "
"<keycombo><keycap>Ctrl</keycap><keycap>P</keycap></keycombo>."

#: src/menus/file/open.xml:13(title)
msgid "Open…"
msgstr "Öppna…"

#: src/menus/file/open.xml:17(secondary) src/menus/file/open.xml:19(primary)
#: src/menus/file/open-recent.xml:13(secondary)
#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:16(secondary)
#: src/menus/file/open-as-link-layer.xml:9(secondary)
#: src/menus/file/open-as-layer.xml:16(secondary)
msgid "Open"
msgstr "Öppna"

#: src/menus/file/open.xml:21(para)
msgid ""
"The <guimenuitem>Open…</guimenuitem> command activates the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-open-dialog\">Open Image</link> dialog that lets you select "
"an image to be loaded from your hard-drive or an external device."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenuitem>Öppna…</guimenuitem> aktiverar dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-open-dialog\">Öppna bild</link>, där du kan välja en bild som"
" ska läsas in från hårddisken eller en extern enhet."

#: src/menus/file/open.xml:26(para)
msgid ""
"For other ways of opening files, see the commands described on the next "
"pages (<xref linkend=\"gimp-file-open-as-layer\"/> etc.)."
msgstr ""
"För andra sätt att öppna filer, se kommandona som beskrivs på nästa sidor "
"(<xref linkend=\"gimp-file-open-as-layer\"/> osv.)."

#: src/menus/file/open-recent.xml:9(title)
#: src/menus/file/open-recent.xml:17(primary)
msgid "Open Recent"
msgstr "Öppna senaste"

#: src/menus/file/open-recent.xml:14(tertiary)
msgid "Open recent"
msgstr "Öppna senaste"

#: src/menus/file/open-recent.xml:20(para)
msgid ""
"Selecting <guimenuitem>Open Recent</guimenuitem> displays a submenu with the"
" names of the files that you have opened recently in "
"<acronym>GIMP</acronym>. Simply click on a name to reopen it. See the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-document-dialog\">Document History dialog</link> at the "
"bottom of the Open Recent submenu if you cannot find your image."
msgstr ""
"När du väljer <guimenuitem>Öppna senaste</guimenuitem> visas en undermeny "
"med namnen på filerna som du nyligen har öppnat i <acronym>GIMP</acronym>. "
"Klicka på ett namn för att öppna filen igen. Se <link linkend=\"gimp-"
"document-dialog\">dialogrutan Dokumenthistorik</link> längst ner i "
"undermenyn Öppna senaste om du inte hittar bilden."

#: src/menus/file/open-recent.xml:30(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open "
#| "Recent</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open "
"Recent</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Öppna "
"senaste</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:12(title)
msgid "Open Location…"
msgstr "Öppna plats…"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:17(tertiary)
msgid "Open location"
msgstr "Öppna plats"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:20(primary)
msgid "Open Location"
msgstr "Öppna plats"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:23(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "This command opens the <quote>Open Location</quote> dialog that lets you "
#| "load an image from a network location, specified by a URI, in any of the "
#| "formats that <acronym>GIMP</acronym> supports."
msgid ""
"This command opens the <quote>Open Location</quote> dialog, which lets you "
"load an image from an online or network location, specified by a URI, in any"
" of the formats that <acronym>GIMP</acronym> supports."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot öppnar dialogrutan <quote>Öppna plats</quote>. Där kan du läsa in "
"en bild via en URI från en plats på nätet eller i ett nätverk, i något av de"
" format som <acronym>GIMP</acronym> stöder."

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:31(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
#| "<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open "
#| "Recent</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgid ""
"You can access this command from the main menu through "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>File</guimenu><guimenuitem>Open "
"Location…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar kommandot i huvudmenyn via "
"<menuchoice><guimenu>Arkiv</guimenu><guimenuitem>Öppna "
"plats…</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:41(title)
msgid "Description of the dialog window"
msgstr "Beskrivning av dialogfönstret"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:42(para)
msgid "The most typical schemes to open images with are:"
msgstr "De vanligaste protokollen för att öppna bilder är:"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:45(term)
msgid "file://"
msgstr "file://"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:47(para)
msgid "to open an image from a local drive"
msgstr "för att öppna en bild från en lokal enhet"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:48(para)
msgid ""
"You can omit the <quote>file://</quote> prefix and open images simply by "
"putting an absolute or relative path and filename in here."
msgstr ""
"Du kan utelämna prefixet <quote>file://</quote> och öppna bilder genom att "
"bara ange en absolut eller relativ sökväg och ett filnamn här."

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:53(para)
msgid ""
"The default base directory for relative paths depends on your operating "
"system. It is typically <filename>/home/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> on "
"Linux, <filename role=\"html\">C:\\Documents and "
"Settings\\&lt;username&gt;\\My Documents\\My Images\\</filename><filename "
"role=\"tex\">C:\\\\Documents and Settings\\\\&lt;username&gt;\\\\My "
"Documents\\\\My Images\\\\</filename> on Windows and "
"<filename>/Users/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> on Mac OS X."
msgstr ""
"Standardkatalogen för relativa sökvägar beror på operativsystemet. Den är "
"vanligen <filename>/home/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> i Linux, <filename "
"role=\"html\">C:\\Documents and Settings\\&lt;username&gt;\\My Documents\\My"
" Images\\</filename><filename role=\"tex\">C:\\\\Documents and "
"Settings\\\\&lt;username&gt;\\\\My Documents\\\\My Images\\\\</filename> i "
"Windows och <filename>/Users/&lt;username&gt;/</filename> i Mac OS X."

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:67(term)
msgid "ftp://"
msgstr "ftp://"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:69(para)
msgid "to open an image from a ftp server"
msgstr "för att öppna en bild från en FTP-server"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:73(term)
#| msgid "http://"
msgid "https://"
msgstr "https://"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:74(term)
msgid "http://"
msgstr "http://"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:76(para)
msgid "to load an image from a website"
msgstr "för att läsa in en bild från en webbplats"

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:78(para)
msgid ""
"When you are visiting an Internet site, you can right-click on an image and "
"choose <quote>Copy link address</quote> in the drop-down menu. Then paste it"
" in the <quote>Open Location</quote> dialog to open it in GIMP."
msgstr ""
"När du besöker en webbplats kan du högerklicka på en bild och välja "
"<quote>Kopiera länkadress</quote> i snabbmenyn. Klistra sedan in den i "
"dialogrutan <quote>Öppna plats</quote> för att öppna bilden i GIMP."

#: src/menus/file/open-location.xml:84(para)
msgid ""
"Even if this command makes it very easy to grab images from web sites: "
"<emphasis> Please respect the copyright! Images, even if published on the "
"Internet are not always free to be used for you. </emphasis>"
msgstr ""
"Även om kommandot gör det mycket enkelt att hämta bilder från webbplatser: "
"<emphasis>Respektera upphovsrätten! Bilder som publiceras på internet får "
"inte alltid användas fritt.</emphasis>"

#: src/menus/file/open-as-link-layer.xml:6(title)
