msgstr "Öppna som länklager"

#: src/menus/file/open-as-link-layer.xml:21(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guimenu>Open Image as layers</guimenu> command opens the <link "
#| "linkend=\"gimp-file-open\">Open Image</link> dialog. The layers of the "
#| "selected file are added to the current image as the top layers in the stack."
msgid ""
"The <guimenu>Open as link layer</guimenu> command opens the <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-open-dialog\">Open Image</link> dialog. The image is added as"
" a so-called <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-type-link-layer\">Link Layer</link> "
"that can be changed and updated separately."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot <guimenu>Öppna som länklager</guimenu> öppnar dialogrutan <link "
"linkend=\"gimp-open-dialog\">Öppna bild</link>. Bilden läggs till som ett så"
" kallat <link linkend=\"gimp-layer-type-link-layer\">länklager</link>, som "
"kan ändras och uppdateras separat."

#: src/menus/file/open-as-link-layer.xml:31(para)
#| msgid ""
#| "You can access this command from the image menubar through "
